Basic attack
<><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><>
The basic attack is a move shared by all classes. It works differently with each class, but
is always there. a basic attack is the only attack that does not consume energy or focus,
making it the only attack that can be consistently used and spammed without support items.
<><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><>
Fighter: attack with your weapon, dealing 2-4 WP damage
-----------------------------------------------------------
Ranger: shoot at the target with your weapon, dealing 1 WP damage and one 1-2 pierce damage.
-----------------------------------------------------------
Alchemist: throw a harmful brew at the target, inflicting the effects of your current brewing
kit (an alchemist's equivalent of a weapon)
-----------------------------------------------------------
Assassin: attack with your weapon, dealing 1 WP damage and 1 peirce damage (affected by WP
modifiers.) Gains you 2 energy.
-----------------------------------------------------------
Scavenger: attack with your weapon, knocking 1 bit of scrap out of the enemy's collection and
dealing 2-3 WP damage.
